                                                "sense_id": "234f158c-43dc-3ca2-bf3f-399a941f2c02",
                                                "text": "to slope the ground in a garden; to slope a piece of cloth in cutting a garment"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7098cdd9-b9fc-34b2-ad91-10da1619c99a",
                                        "entry_id": "f316381c-6369-3fac-9260-1597a9df4c68",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To try to move surreptitiously."
